  "description": "Optional, not the default. As asr-vertex-gemini-aligned (Gemini text, word times from local faster-whisper aligned to it); segments the reference did not align are then filled from forced alignment of the Gemini text (MMS_FA, mean score >= 0.7) when they stay between the neighbouring timed segments. Filled segments are word-citable on the acoustic score alone and are marked independent_confirmation: false. Needs server/requirements-align.txt for the fill; without it the primary alignment stands.",
